<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="bg-[#0A0B10]">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="csrf-token" content={get_csrf_token()} />
    <title>Heads Up Fantasy — 1-on-1 fantasy, settled tonight</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Challenge a friend to a head-to-head fantasy draft. Real players, real stats, a winner the same night."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Heads Up Fantasy" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Challenge a friend to a head-to-head fantasy draft." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link phx-track-static rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#0A0B10] text-[#F4F5F7] antialiased">
    <header class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-5">
      <span class="text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight">
        Heads<span class="text-[#C8FF2E]">Up</span>
      </span>
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm">
        <a href={~p"/login"} class="font-bold text-[#8B91A7] hover:text-[#F4F5F7]">Sign in</a>
        <a
          href={~p"/signup"}
          class="rounded-lg bg-[#C8FF2E] px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0A0B10] hover:brightness-110"
        >
          Play free
        </a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5">
      <section class="py-14 sm:py-20">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9F8BFF]">
          1-on-1 fantasy · WNBA · MLB · NFL
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
          Challenge a friend.<br />
          <span class="text-[#C8FF2E]">Draft head to head.</span><br />
          Settle it tonight.
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#B9BECF]">
          No season-long commitment, no twelve-team league, no waiting until January. Pick a slate,
          snake-draft against one friend, and real box scores decide it before you go to bed.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={~p"/signup"}
            class="rounded-xl bg-[#C8FF2E] px-6 py-4 text-base font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0A0B10] hover:brightness-110"
          >
            Create your account
          </a>
          <a
            href={~p"/login"}
            class="rounded-xl border border-[#252A3A] px-6 py-4 text-base font-bold text-[#F4F5F7] hover:border-[#C8FF2E]/50"
          >
            I already have one
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#565D73]">
          Free to play. Plays in your browser — nothing to install.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-[#1A1E2B] py-14 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#C8FF2E]">01 · Challenge</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-black">Pick your terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#8B91A7]">
            Sport, roster size, and which slate counts. Send it to a friend and they accept, decline,
            or counter with their own terms.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#C8FF2E]">02 · Draft</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-black">Live snake draft</h2>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#8B91A7]">
            A coin flip decides the first pick, then you alternate on a ticking clock. Miss it and
            the auto-pick takes the best player left.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#C8FF2E]">03 · Settle</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-black">Real stats, real winner</h2>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#8B91A7]">
            Watch both rosters score live off actual box scores. When the last game ends, the winner
            is called automatically.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-[#1A1E2B] py-14">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#252A3A] bg-[#12141D] px-6 py-10 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black">Your move.</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-[#8B91A7]">
            Takes a few seconds to sign up, and you start with 1,000 coins to stake on duels.
          </p>
          <a
            href={~p"/signup"}
            class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-xl bg-[#C8FF2E] px-6 py-4 text-base font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0A0B10] hover:brightness-110"
          >
            Play free
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pb-10 pt-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[#1A1E2B] pt-6 text-xs text-[#565D73]">
        <span>© {Date.utc_today().year} Heads Up Fantasy</span>
        <nav class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-[#8B91A7]">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/support" class="hover:text-[#8B91A7]">Support</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#3A4157]">
        Coins are a free in-app score only. They cannot be purchased, cashed out, or transferred, and
        have no monetary value.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
